cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use METEOR in your research or product, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "METEOR: Multi-task Estimation of Traffic Elements, Objects & Roads"
abstract: >-
  A surround-view multi-task driving network (8 cameras, 12 tasks, one static
  TensorRT graph) trained entirely on auto-generated ground truth from the
  CoMET autolabel factory, deployed on Jetson AGX Orin with INT8 and 2:4
  structured sparsity.
